WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.544 --> 00:00:18.128
"See you tomorrow, Bobby!"

2
00:00:18.129 --> 00:00:22.462
Bobby watched his friends get into a car with their soccer gear.

3
00:00:22.463 --> 00:00:26.246
They were heading to their team's first game of the season.

4
00:00:26.247 --> 00:00:30.372
"Don't let the Panthers score any goals," Bobby called.

5
00:00:30.373 --> 00:00:33.304
"And remember to pass the ball!"

6
00:00:33.305 --> 00:00:38.511
As the car disappeared, Bobby let out a big sigh.

7
00:00:38.512 --> 00:00:44.623
Then he grabbed his crutches and started hopping through the hallway.

8
00:00:44.624 --> 00:00:48.548
In the gym Miss Shelly was putting food on a table.

9
00:00:48.549 --> 00:00:52.038
"Good!" Bobby thought.

10
00:00:52.039 --> 00:00:56.379
"Miss Shelly, are we cooking today?" he asked.

11
00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:59.971
"Miss Shelly has her chef hat on," Jason said.

12
00:00:59.972 --> 00:01:02.303
"That means we're cooking!"

13
00:01:02.304 --> 00:01:08.657
"We're making nutty sweeties today," Miss Shelly said.

14
00:01:08.658 --> 00:01:12.199
"Nutty sweeties?" Jason laughed.

15
00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:14.475
"That's a funny name."

16
00:01:14.476 --> 00:01:16.586
Bobby was looking at the table.

17
00:01:16.587 --> 00:01:20.169
"There are only a few ingredients," he said.

18
00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:22.645
"You're right," Miss Shelly said.

19
00:01:22.646 --> 00:01:26.870
"That's because these treats are very easy to make."

20
00:01:26.871 --> 00:01:30.135
Bobby also noticed a machine sitting on the table.

21
00:01:30.136 --> 00:01:32.594
"What's that?" he asked.

22
00:01:32.595 --> 00:01:37.319
"It's a mini food processor," Miss Shelly explained.

23
00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:40.607
"It will chop the fruit and nuts for us.

24
00:01:40.608 --> 00:01:43.766
It makes our work go more quickly."

25
00:01:43.767 --> 00:01:46.975
"That sounds good!" Bobby said.

26
00:01:46.976 --> 00:01:50.940
Cooking was fun, but sometimes it took a lot of time.

27
00:01:50.941 --> 00:01:54.109
Jason began reading the instructions out loud.

28
00:01:54.110 --> 00:02:01.053
"Step one: chop one-half cup of raisins."

29
00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:04.068
He measured and dumped in the raisins.

30
00:02:04.069 --> 00:02:07.483
"Now fire up the machine, Nina!"

31
00:02:07.484 --> 00:02:14.711
Nina pushed the button on the machine. Whirr! It made a loud sound.

32
00:02:14.712 --> 00:02:23.948
"Now we set the raisins aside and chop the mixed nuts," Nina said.

33
00:02:23.949 --> 00:02:27.472
Bobby scooped one-third cup nuts.

34
00:02:27.473 --> 00:02:32.187
Whirr! In a second all the nuts were chopped.

35
00:02:32.188 --> 00:02:44.398
"That was so fast! This machine is amazing!" He laughed.

36
00:02:44.399 --> 00:02:47.579
"Here are the four tablespoons of melted butter."

37
00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:51.385
Ethan poured the butter into the large mixing bowl.

38
00:02:51.386 --> 00:02:56.215
Izzie stirred the chopped raisins, nuts, and butter together.

39
00:02:56.216 --> 00:03:01.388
"Some cooks use peanut butter instead of butter," Miss Shelly said.

40
00:03:01.389 --> 00:03:06.978
"Then the snacks would be called super nutty sweeties!" Nina said.

41
00:03:06.979 --> 00:03:12.849
"Now for the fun part—we roll the mixture into little balls."

42
00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:15.013
Jason held up a tray.

43
00:03:15.014 --> 00:03:18.064
"And then we roll them in shredded coconut."

44
00:03:18.065 --> 00:03:23.556
Bobby took some of the mixture and made a little ball.

45
00:03:23.557 --> 00:03:27.134
He rolled it in the coconut.

46
00:03:27.135 --> 00:03:32.988
"Cool. They look like snowy soccer balls."

47
00:03:32.989 --> 00:03:36.714
"Who wants to taste one?" Miss Shelly asked.

48
00:03:36.715 --> 00:03:42.114
"Me!" Everybody raised their hands and reached for a nutty sweetie.

49
00:03:42.115 --> 00:03:48.130
"Let's put the rest in the refrigerator for later," Miss Shelly said.

50
00:03:48.131 --> 00:03:53.365
Jason took a bite. "Mmm. Delicious."

51
00:03:53.366 --> 00:03:57.806
"Nutty sweeties would be great after a soccer game."

52
00:03:57.807 --> 00:04:01.404
Bobby sighed as he looked down at the long cast on his leg.

53
00:04:01.405 --> 00:04:05.398
"If I ever get to play again."

54
00:04:05.399 --> 00:04:09.412
"Hey, want to play soccer right now?" Ethan asked.

55
00:04:09.413 --> 00:04:14.138
"What? My leg. I can't . . ." Bobby looked up.

56
00:04:14.139 --> 00:04:18.477
On the table Ethan had made two little goals with paper cups.

57
00:04:18.478 --> 00:04:22.206
Then Jason crumpled up some paper to form a ball.

58
00:04:22.207 --> 00:04:25.828
"We can play table soccer, silly!"

59
00:04:25.829 --> 00:04:33.617
"Oh!" Bobby grinned. "Game on!"
